"inkommande ΔE: \tmed. %.2f ; \tmax. %.2f\n"
"VB ΔE: \tmed. %.2f; \tmax. %.2f\n"
"utgående ΔE: \tmed. %.2f; \tmax. %.2f\n"
"\n"
"<b>Profildata</b>\n"
"ljuskälla:  \t%.0f K \t%s\n"
"matris i anpassningsrymd:\n"
"<tt>%+.4f \t%+.4f \t%+.4f\n"
